{"title":"住建部科技创新“十三五”专项规划出台，８大重点任务","date":"2017-08-31","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#222222;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">住建部科技创新&ldquo;十三五&rdquo;专项规划出台，８大重点任务</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#222222;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px;\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdlc\" style=\"line-height: 30px; border-left-width: 3px; border-left-style: solid; border-left-color: rgb(95, 170, 255); padding: 0px 0px 5px 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left: 0;text-indent:32px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left: 0;text-indent:32px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">住建部</span>发布《住房城乡建设<span style=\"border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">科技创新</span>&ldquo;十三五&rdquo;专项规划》出台,为促进建筑产业发展提质增效，规划部署八大重点任务!</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 29, 29);\">8月28日，住建部发布《住房城乡建设科技创新&ldquo;十三五&rdquo;专项规划》（以下简称《规划》），提出在关键技术和装备研发应用取得重大进展和基本形成科技创新体系的发展目标。《规划》特别指出发展智慧建造技术，普及和深化<span style=\"border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">BIM</span>应用，发展施工机器人、智能施工装备、<span style=\"border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">3D打印</span>施工装备，促进建筑产业提质增效。</span></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 15pt 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 29, 29); border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm;\">建筑业</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 29, 29);\">在我国国民经济中的作用十分突出，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2016</span>年总产值达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">19.36</span>万亿元，从业者超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">5185</span>万人，是名符其实的支柱产业。但是必须清楚的认识到，建筑业科技含量较低，建筑施工行业作业效率普遍低下、原材料消耗大、环境<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm\">污染</span>，整体盈利能力差，建筑业面临转型升级的压力，而科技创新正是建筑业转型升级的重要推手。推动装配化、信息化、绿色化和设计施工一体化，全面提升建筑业工业化、信息化水平。<b>此次《规划》的发布，成为&ldquo;十三五&rdquo;时期建筑业科技创新发展的指导性文件和行动纲领。</b></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#1D1D1D\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 15pt 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 29, 29);\">《规划》全文<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>千余字，分为发展基础与趋势、总体要求、重点任务和保障措施<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>大板块。第一个板块是发展基础，总结了我国建筑业科技创新在&ldquo;十二五&rdquo;取得的成绩，并介绍了建筑业科技创新的发展趋势。第二个板块是总体要求，由指导思想、基本原则、发展目标构成。第三个板块是重点任务，由推动规划设计<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm\">技术创新</span>、推动智能化技术应用、提升<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">节能减排</span>技术水平等<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>部分构成。第四个板块是保障措施，主要是对规划实施与配套管理进行了明确。</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; margin: 5px auto; white-space: normal;\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdtc 96wx-color\" style=\"white-space: normal; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 10px; max-width: 100%; border-top-width: 3px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: rgb(216, 40, 33) rgb(216, 40, 33) rgb(229, 229, 229); border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(216, 40, 33); font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:宋体\">&ldquo;1+2&rdquo;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:宋体\">定性目标</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">《规划》提出了&lsquo;1+2&rsquo;定性目标。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">&ldquo;1&rdquo;是指总体目标</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">，即统筹技术研发、应用示范、标准制定、规模推广和科技评价的全链条管理，抓好人才、基地、项目、资金、政策五大创新要素，取得一批前瞻性、引领性、实用性科技成果，显著增强行业科技创新的供给和支撑能力。</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">&ldquo;2&rdquo;是指2个分类目标</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">，为关键技术和装备研发应用取得重大进展、科技创新体系基本形成。</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; margin: 5px auto; white-space: normal;\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdtc 96wx-color\" style=\"white-space: normal; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 10px; max-width: 100%; border-top-width: 3px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: rgb(216, 40, 33) rgb(216, 40, 33) rgb(229, 229, 229); border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(216, 40, 33); font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:宋体\">8</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:宋体\">大重点任务</span></strong></section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">《规划》提出&ldquo;十三五&rdquo;时期，建筑业科技创新的8大重点任务，包括推动规划设计技术创新、推动智能化技术应用、提升节能减排技术水平、加强技术集成应用、构建<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">绿色建筑</span>技术体系、发展绿色建造方式、推广经济适用技术、强化创新能力建设。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D;font-weight:normal\">（1）</span><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">推动规划设计<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">技术创新</span>，促进形成集约空间格局。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">加快建立空间规划&ldquo;一张蓝图&rdquo;技术体系；推进城市存量规划与绿色发展技术集成融合；加强城乡历史<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">文化遗产</span>、风景名胜区和<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">世界遗产</span>保护利用。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">（2）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">推动智能化技术应用，促进城市安全高效运行。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">推进城市管理精细化；推动城市基础设施建设运行智能化；提高城市综合防灾能力。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">（3）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">提升<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">节能减排</span>技术水平，促进低碳节约循环发展。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">发展更高性能的建筑节能新技术；加快构建城镇污水全收集、全处理技术支撑体系；推动建设生活垃圾分类存放、分类收集、分类运输、分类处理体系。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">（4）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">加强技术集成应用，促进城市环境生态宜居。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">构建多尺度、多层次城市生态保护与修复技术体系；发展城市水环境质量改善和水生态修复成套技术；加强居住区环境质量保障技术研究。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">（5）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">构建绿色建筑技术体系，促进建筑品质显著提升。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">提高绿色建筑技术集成度，建立<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">绿色建筑</span>运行效果数据库和基于<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-weight:normal\">BIM</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-weight:normal\">的运营与监测平台</span></strong>；提升既有居住建筑宜居性；加大绿色建材开发应用。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 20px 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">（6）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">发展绿色建造方式，促进建筑产业提质增效。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;color:#1D1D1D\">发展低环境影响和资源高效利用的绿色施工技术体系；构建装配式建筑技术体系；推动智慧建造技术发展，普及和深化BIM应用，发展施工机器人、智能施工装备、<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">3D</span><span style=\"border:none windowtext 1px;padding:0\">打印</span>施工装备。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 15pt 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>）</span></strong><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#1D1D1D\">推广经济适用技术，促进农村环境明显改善。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#1D1D1D\">发展乡村与特色小镇规划建设实用技术；发展民居建筑性能改造与提升技术；构建农村环境整治技术体系。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 15pt 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>）</span></strong><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#1D1D1D\">强化创新能力建设，促进科技成果推广转化。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#1D1D1D\">加快推进科技创新基地建设；推动行业智库和科技人才队伍建设；大力推进科技成果转化应用。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 15pt 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#1D1D1D\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 15pt 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; margin: 5px auto; white-space: normal;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:5px auto\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdc\" style=\"border-radius: 0.8em; width: 100%; border: 2px solid rgb(95, 170, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"border-radius: 0.8em; width: 100%; display: table; padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: table-cell; padding: 10px; line-height: 1.2;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding:10px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:30px;text-indent:2em\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">建筑企业要根据市场需求变化和技术发展趋势，积极探索<span style=\"border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">互联网</span>技术在工程建设管理中的应用，引进先进的BIM技术管理手段，搭乘&ldquo;<span style=\"border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">互联网</span>+&rdquo;快车，提升项目精细化管理水平，提高项目建设品质，依靠<span style=\"border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">科技创新</span>来提升核心竞争力。</span></strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}